msgstr "Mod senapang cahaya"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wait for vertical blank before presenting.\n"
"Prevents tearing but adds up to one frame of latency."
msgstr ""
"Tunggu kosong menegak sebelum memaparkan.\n"
"Mengelakkan koyakan tetapi menambah kependaman sehingga satu bingkai."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Pemberitahuan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic (system)"
msgstr "Automatik (sistem)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Bahasa"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "GPU"
msgstr "GPU"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto (best)"
msgstr "Auto (terbaik)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "Pemapar"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Software"
msgstr "Perisian"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Which renderer draws the game. Applies on the\n"
"next launch - save settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Pemapar yang melukis permainan. Berkuat kuasa pada\n"
"pelancaran seterusnya - simpan tetapan dan lancar semula."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Window size"
msgstr "Saiz tetingkap"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Lebar"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Tinggi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "1x (native)"
msgstr "1x (asli)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "8x (4K)"
msgstr "8x (4K)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D render scale"
msgstr "Skala pemaparan 3D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Internal 3D rendering resolution. Higher is crisper 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD stays sharp). GPU backends only; the software\n"
"renderer stays native. Applies on the next launch - save\n"
"settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Resolusi pemaparan 3D dalaman. Lebih tinggi, 3D lebih tajam\n"
"(2D/HUD kekal tajam). Bahagian belakang GPU sahaja; pemapar\n"
"perisian kekal asli. Berkuat kuasa pada pelancaran\n"
"seterusnya - simpan tetapan dan lancar semula."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "Bilinear"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Integer"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "Terdekat"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sharp-bilinear"
msgstr "Bilinear tajam"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D scaling"
msgstr "Penskalaan 2D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How the frame is magnified to the window.\n"
"Sharp-bilinear keeps 2D text crisp without the shimmer\n"
"nearest shows at non-integer window sizes. Integer snaps\n"
"to a whole multiple (pixel-perfect, with black bars).\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Cara bingkai dibesarkan ke tetingkap.\n"
"Bilinear tajam mengekalkan teks 2D tajam tanpa kerlipan\n"
"yang ditunjukkan terdekat pada saiz bukan integer. Integer\n"
"melaraskan ke gandaan penuh (piksel sempurna, dengan jalur\n"
"hitam). Berkuat kuasa serta-merta."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "4:3 (arcade)"
msgstr "4:3 (arked)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Square pixels"
msgstr "Piksel segi empat sama"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stretch"
msgstr "Regangkan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "Nisbah aspek"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"4:3 is the arcade monitor's shape (the default).\n"
"Square pixels shows the raw 496x384 (slightly narrow).\n"
"Stretch fills the whole window. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"4:3 ialah bentuk monitor arked (lalai).\n"
"Piksel segi empat sama memaparkan 496x384 mentah (agak sempit).\n"
"Regangkan memenuhi seluruh tetingkap. Berkuat kuasa serta-merta."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "CRT filter"
msgstr "Penapis CRT"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A cosmetic arcade-monitor look over the finished frame:\n"
"scanlines, an RGB shadow mask, glow and optional screen\n"
"curvature. Purely visual; applies live."
msgstr ""
"Rupa kosmetik monitor arked di atas bingkai akhir:\n"
"garis imbasan, topeng bayang RGB, cahaya dan kelengkungan\n"
"skrin pilihan. Visual semata-mata; berkuat kuasa serta-merta."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "Garis imbasan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "Topeng"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Glow"
msgstr "Cahaya"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Curvature"
msgstr "Kelengkungan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enhancement (cosmetic, beyond the original hardware)"
msgstr "Peningkatan (kosmetik, melangkaui perkakasan asal)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropic"
msgstr "Anisotropik"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Faithful"
msgstr "Setia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D texture filter"
msgstr "Penapis tekstur 3D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(unsupported)"
msgstr "(tidak disokong)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This GPU does not report anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "GPU ini tidak melaporkan sokongan penapisan anisotropik."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropy"
msgstr "Anisotropi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D upscale"
msgstr "Peningkatan skala 2D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Edge-smooth the 2D layers (HUD, text, menus). xBR and\n"
"ScaleFX round diagonals; Faithful keeps crisp pixels.\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Licinkan tepi lapisan 2D (HUD, teks, menu). xBR dan\n"
"ScaleFX membulatkan pepenjuru; Setia mengekalkan piksel tajam.\n"
"Berkuat kuasa serta-merta."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blended"
msgstr "Diadun"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stipple"
msgstr "Bintik"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translucency"
msgstr "Lut cahaya"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The hardware draws see-through surfaces (lights, glass,\n"
"shadows) as a checkerboard. Blended draws the 50%\n"
"see-through surface it's trying to achieve. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Perkakasan melukis permukaan lut sinar (lampu, kaca,\n"
"bayang) sebagai corak papan dam. Diadun melukis permukaan\n"
"50% lut sinar yang cuba dicapainya. Berkuat kuasa serta-merta."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom textures"
msgstr "Tekstur tersuai"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replace the game's 3D textures with images saved in\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, named as dumped. GPU\n"
"renderers only; Reload picks up edited files."
msgstr ""
"Gantikan tekstur 3D permainan dengan imej yang disimpan dalam\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, dinamakan seperti yang dilonggok.\n"
"Pemapar GPU sahaja; Muat semula membaca fail yang disunting."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%zu loaded"
msgstr "%zu dimuatkan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Muat semula"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dump textures"
msgstr "Longgok tekstur"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Collect every 3D texture the game draws and write them,\n"
"with an index.html to browse, to saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"when the game exits or this is turned off."
msgstr ""
"Kumpul setiap tekstur 3D yang dilukis permainan dan tulisnya,\n"
"dengan index.html untuk melayar, ke saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"apabila permainan keluar atau pilihan ini dimatikan."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Audio"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Paths"
msgstr "Laluan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Layari..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Config directory"
msgstr "Direktori konfigurasi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where sm2-emu.ini is read from and saved to.\n"
"Set with --config <dir>; cannot be changed here."
msgstr ""
"Tempat sm2-emu.ini dibaca dan disimpan.\n"
"Ditetapkan dengan --config <dir>; tidak boleh diubah di sini."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROM directory"
msgstr "Direktori ROM"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the ROM archives live. A game launched by name is\n"
"loaded from here as <name>.zip or <name>.7z."
msgstr ""
"Tempat arkib ROM disimpan. Permainan yang dilancarkan dengan\n"
"nama dimuatkan dari sini sebagai <name>.zip atau <name>.7z."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves directory"
msgstr "Direktori simpanan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Battery-backed saves: per-game NVRAM (.nv) and EEPROM\n"
"(.eeprom) images -- high scores and operator settings."
msgstr ""
"Simpanan berbateri: imej NVRAM (.nv) dan EEPROM (.eeprom)\n"
"setiap permainan -- skor tertinggi dan tetapan pengendali."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshots directory"
msgstr "Direktori tangkapan skrin"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where F12 screenshots are written."
msgstr "Tempat tangkapan skrin F12 ditulis."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrape artwork online"
msgstr "Dapatkan karya seni dalam talian"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let the game picker fetch box art and descriptions from\n"
"ArcadeDB over the network. Off keeps sm2-emu offline: the\n"
"picker still lists and launches every game, with placeholder\n"
"tiles and no descriptions."
msgstr ""
"Benarkan pemilih permainan mendapatkan seni kotak dan perihalan\n"
"dari ArcadeDB melalui rangkaian. Mati mengekalkan sm2-emu luar\n"
"talian: pemilih masih menyenarai dan melancarkan setiap permainan,\n"
"dengan jubin pemegang tempat dan tanpa perihalan."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
