msgid "If you'd like to support development:"
msgstr "Jika anda ingin menyokong pembangunan:"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Simpan tetapan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Saved to %s"
msgstr "Disimpan ke %s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wheel connected."
msgstr "Stereng disambungkan."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "No wheel connected. Settings still apply once one is."
msgstr "Tiada stereng disambungkan. Tetapan tetap terpakai apabila ada."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force feedback"
msgstr "Force feedback"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wheel force on driving games: centring and cornering\n"
"forces decoded from the game's own drive-board commands,\n"
"plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
msgstr ""
"Daya stereng dalam permainan memandu: daya pemusatan dan\n"
"selekoh dinyahkod daripada arahan drive board permainan,\n"
"serta hentakan impak apabila anda melanggar sesuatu."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resistance"
msgstr "Rintangan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invert force feedback"
msgstr "Songsangkan force feedback"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a wheel whose driver pushes the wrong way: it pulls\n"
"away from the centre instead of bringing it back, and\n"
"the game's forces go the opposite way."
msgstr ""
"Untuk stereng yang pemacunya menolak ke arah salah: ia menarik\n"
"menjauhi tengah dan bukannya membawanya kembali, dan\n"
"daya permainan pergi ke arah bertentangan."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble"
msgstr "Getaran"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts, for wheels without force\n"
"feedback. It never runs alongside force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Bergetar pada impak permainan, untuk stereng tanpa force\n"
"feedback. Ia tidak pernah berjalan bersama force feedback."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble strength"
msgstr "Kekuatan getaran"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Engine vibration"
msgstr "Getaran enjin"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows with the throttle. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Getaran tambahan yang meningkat dengan pendikit. Ia bukan\n"
"dari permainan. Matikan untuk merasa force feedback permainan sahaja."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%u deg"
msgstr "%u darjah"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering range"
msgstr "Julat stereng"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set this to your wheel's own rotation range. The lock\n"
"angle below is mapped onto it, so matching your wheel\n"
"gives arcade-like response."
msgstr ""
"Tetapkan kepada julat putaran stereng anda sendiri. Sudut\n"
"kunci di bawah dipetakan kepadanya, jadi memadankan stereng\n"
"anda memberi tindak balas seperti arked."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lock angle"
msgstr "Sudut kunci"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%d deg"
msgstr "%d darjah"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How far to physically turn for full game lock (total,\n"
"so half each side of centre). Lower is more sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Sejauh mana perlu dipusing untuk kunci penuh permainan\n"
"(jumlah, jadi separuh setiap sisi). Lebih rendah lebih sensitif."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Axes"
msgstr "Paksi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto-detected. Recalibrate if steering or a pedal is wrong."
msgstr "Dikesan secara automatik. Tentukur semula jika stereng atau pedal salah."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering"
msgstr "Stereng"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accelerator"
msgstr "Pemecut"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Brake"
msgstr "Brek"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "auto"
msgstr "auto"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "axis %d (inverted)"
msgstr "paksi %d (songsang)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "axis %d"
msgstr "paksi %d"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "operate it..."
msgstr "gerakkannya..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "cancel"
msgstr "batal"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Calibrate"
